<title>UK: JGB futures in London rise with U.S..</title>
<headline>JGB futures in London rise with U.S..</headline>
<text>
<p>1630 GMT - JGB futures strengthen on back of robust U.S. market, which took heart from soft labour cost data. Tokyo market was on holiday overnight.</p>
<p>* June JGB future at 125.58, up 0.37 from LIFFE close Mon</p>
<p>* 182nd JGB yields 2.285 pct vs 2.295 late in London Mon</p>
